named SRCGC. Code generation for pure SR systems currently works, and
they are studying code generation for mixed domain systems. Their final
goal is to provide tools for separate development of the control and
data processing parts of an application. SR and SDF (synchronous
dataflow) could be used for prototyping, and SRCGC and CGC (code
