and an on-line version of the documentation is at

     http://wwwsi.supelec.fr/fb/doc_ocpl/ocpl.html

A public version of SRCGC should be made available in April or May. This
work is done in collaboration with Xavier Warzee at Thomson TCO, and they
agreed to make the new domain publicly available.


